ity || ''}</span>\n              </div>\n            ` : ''}\n            ${bauherrPhone ? `\n              <div class=\"info-row\">\n                <span class=\"info-label\">Telefon:</span>\n                <span class=\"info-value\">${bauherrPhone}</span>\n              </div>\n            ` : ''}\n            ${bauherrMobile ? `\n              <div class=\"info-row\">\n                <span class=\"info-label\">Mobil:</span>\n                <span class=\"info-value\">${bauherrMobile}</span>\n              </div>\n            ` : ''}\n            ${bauherrEmail ? `\n              <div class=\"info-row\">\n                <span class=\"info-label\">E-Mail:</span>\n                <span class=\"info-value\">${bauherrEmail}</span>\n              </div>\n            ` : ''}\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        ${project?.project_type ? `\n          <div class=\"project-type-header\">\n            <span class=\"project-type-text\">${project.project_type}${project.project_type_date ? ` vom ${new Date(project.project_type_date).toLocaleDateString('de-DE')}` : ''}</span>\n          </div>\n        ` : ''}\n        \n        ${roofs.length > 0 ? `\n        <div class=\"roofs-section\">\n          <h2>Dachflächen</h2>\n          ${roofsHtml}\n        </div>\n        ` : ''}\n        \n        ${checklists.length > 0 ? `\n        <div class=\"checklists-section checklists-page-break\">\n          <h2>Checklisten</h2>\n          ${checklistsHtml}\n        </div>\n        ` : ''}\n        </div><!-- end .page -->\n        \n        ${photos.length > 0 ? `\n          <div class=\"new-page\">\n            <div class=\"photos-section\">\n              <h2>Fotos</h2>\n              ${photosHtml}\n            </div>\n            ${sketches.length === 0 ? `\n              ${remarks || project?.remarks ? `\n                <div class=\"remarks-section\" style=\"margin-top: 30px;\">\n                  <h2>Bemerkungen</h2>\n                  <div class=\"remarks-box\